	Has anyone gotten 'Amiga NetHack 3.0 PL10' to save a game when run
by double-clicking on the 'NetHack' icon?  I can only save a game if I run
the program from the 'NewGame' icon.  I did some snooping via 'SnoopDos'
and discovered that NetHack is trying to open a file called 'G:NetHack'
which is where I have NetHack: and HackExe: assigned to on my system.
It appears that NetHack is forgetting to append the character's name
to the path it is trying to open, and ends up trying to open a directory
(as a file!) to write out the saved game.  I have my nethack.cnf file
set to 'SAVE=NetHack:save' but the 'save' dir is never referenced.

